### Requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension. Start the API first:
###   uvicorn backend.main:app --port 8000
@api = http://127.0.0.1:8000

GET {{api}}/health

###
GET {{api}}/model/info

### One flow (a real DDoS flow from the test split)
POST {{api}}/predict
Content-Type: application/json

< ./flow_ddos.json

### Six flows at once
POST {{api}}/predict/batch
Content-Type: application/json

< ./batch.json

### Recent alerts, newest first
GET {{api}}/alerts?limit=20

### Paste a prediction_id from a /predict response
GET {{api}}/explanations/PASTE_PREDICTION_ID?k=5

###
GET {{api}}/metrics
